        "targetText": "Positive real L² operator: genuine square root and energyAttributed ASTIS background completion supporting Fan Chen, Sinho Chewi, Jianfeng Lu and Matthew S. Zhang. This real scalar-root construction is ASTIS-authored; it is not the printed joint GammaP, B.11 operator identity or a main theorem.arXiv:2609.06905v1; Lean4.33.0/fixedMathlib · Appendix D.1 positive real square-root background; B.10-B.11 scalar defect energy precursor. ASTIS background completion, not printed joint GammaP. · faithful paraphraseComplete source statement (Samplinglib restatement)Let Ω be an arbitrary measurable space and μ any measure. Let D be a bounded positive real-linear operator on L²(μ;ℝ); positivity includes selfadjointness. There exists a bounded positive REAL operator Γ with Γ²=D, and for EVERY real L² cl",
