        "targetText": "1. Reuse the genuine positive complex liftThe compiled canonical complexification theorem constructs ι, the real-part map R, pointwise conjugation C and positive complex-linear Dc from D. It proves Fix(C)=ran(ι) and Dcι=ιD internally. All maps act on actual AE classes for the same arbitrary measure.DC≥0,DCι=ιD,Fix(C)=ran(ι).Corresponding Lean stepL2RealComplexOperator.exists_positive_complex_lift; hfixed; hintertwine",
