          "bottom": 255.5625,
          "left": 328.5
        },
        "targetText": "6. Transport positivity and derive the energy identityThe embedding preserves inner products. Therefore complex selfadjointness and positivity of Rc imply real selfadjointness and positivity of Γ. Its symmetry and exact square now yield ‖Γu‖²=⟨Γu,Γu⟩ℝ=⟨Γ²u,u⟩ℝ=⟨Du,u⟩ℝ for every u. No invertibility or strict positive lower bound follows on the full space.Γ≥0,‖Γu‖2=⟨Γ2u,u⟩R=⟨Du,u⟩R.Corresponding Lean stepinner_embed; hΓ; hΓSq; real_inner_self_eq_norm_sq",
