        "targetText": "Actual PBPS squared defect: positive real root and energyAttributed ASTIS background completion supporting Fan Chen, Sinho Chewi, Jianfeng Lu and Matthew S. Zhang. This real scalar-root construction is ASTIS-authored; it is not the printed joint GammaP, B.11 operator identity or a main theorem.arXiv:2609.06905v1; Lean4.33.0/fixedMathlib · Appendix D.1 positive real square-root background; B.10-B.11 scalar defect energy precursor. ASTIS background completion, not printed joint GammaP. · faithful paraphraseComplete source statement (Samplinglib restatement)Let E be a finite-dimensional real Hilbert Borel space with canonical volume, including the explicit rank-zero extension. Let V:E→ℝ be C², let 0<α≤β, and assume α‖v‖²≤D²V(x)[v,v]≤β‖v‖² for every x,v. Assume η>0 and βη≤1. Define μ(dx) propo",
