        "targetText": "1. Produce the genuine reflected kernel and scalar defectThe independently verified centered-defect producer under the displayed original potential and step assumptions supplies probability μ,J,ν, the every-state normalized Markov S, genuine disintegration with both stationary marginals, and the same selfadjoint contractive mean-preserving T with AE conditional action. It proves D=I−T² positive internally, including the nontrivial constant mode; no caller operator or positivity certificate is used.S(y,dx)∝exp[−V(y+x2)−‖y−x‖28η]dx,Tu(y)=∫u(x)S(y,dx),D=I−T2≥0.Corresponding Lean stepCenteredDefectOperator.actual_centered_selfadjoint_defect; hBase; hAll; hD",
